    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"SoftwareApplication","name":"Scrapfly","description":"Power web scrapers and AI agents with Scrapfly's web data platform. One API key for reliable access to public web data, managed Chromium over CDP, residential proxies, screenshots, and structured extraction.","applicationCategory":"DeveloperApplication","operatingSystem":"Any","offers":{"@type":"Offer","price":"0","priceCurrency":"USD","description":"1,000 free API credits, no credit card required"},"aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","ratingValue":"4.9","ratingCount":"236","bestRating":"5","worstRating":"1"},"url":"https:\/\/scrapfly.io\/","review":[{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Daria I."},"datePublished":"2023-11-22","name":"Great service!","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"Easy to use, affordable price, great work with IP rotation"},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Wille R.","jobTitle":"CEO"},"datePublished":"2026-04-16","name":"Very impressive!","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"JP S."},"datePublished":"2023-11-29","name":"Reliable web scraping service","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Alex C.","jobTitle":"Owner"},"datePublished":"2025-12-29","name":"Scrapfly is great!","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"great experience, everything was easy to setup and i was up and running in minutes. will refer to my friends."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Jason C."},"datePublished":"2024-04-10","name":"Recently switched to Scrapfly","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"After transitioning to Scrapfly from another provider, we were delighted with the outcomes. The switch was seamless and swift, allowing us to get up and running in record time. Our experience with Scrapfly has been exceptionally satisfying!"},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"M\u00e1rk\u00f3 M.","jobTitle":"Student"},"datePublished":"2025-11-15","name":"My opinion","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"My overall experience is not much yet, because I do not use it so much time, but it is clearly positive, as I did not have any problem with the things I got."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Thomas S."},"datePublished":"2024-06-19","name":"Easy to set up, consistent results","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Jason A."},"datePublished":"2024-01-06","name":"Experience Using Scrapfly","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Tom S."},"datePublished":"2023-05-24","name":"Scrapfly for scraping","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Verified Reviewer"},"datePublished":"2024-10-28","name":"Integration was a very easy","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"So far, it is a very useful tool that allows us to improve our scrapping."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Verified Reviewer"},"datePublished":"2025-03-07","name":"Amazing experience","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"Amazing, perfect way to start with scrapping without any complexity (I tried my own scrapping stack with a proxy service)"},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Richard L.","jobTitle":"Software Engineer"},"datePublished":"2026-04-11","name":"Excellent service for scraping difficult websites","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Axel D."},"datePublished":"2023-03-30","name":"Efficace, pratique et simple d'utilisation","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"J'ai cod\u00e9 mon propre scraper et j'utilise Scrapfly comme proxy."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Sebastian T."},"datePublished":"2024-05-27","name":"Great tool to scrape website data efficiently and reliably","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Dhruv K."},"datePublished":"2026-02-20","name":"The Swiss Army Knife of Web Scraping","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"Scrapfly has become an indispensable tool in my stack. If you're doing any kind of serious data collection at scale, this saves you an enormous amount of headache."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Verified Reviewer"},"datePublished":"2024-03-27","name":"Scrape as a service, quickly!","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"Great. They have receptive support and even offered tips for my current scrapes."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Bodo T."},"datePublished":"2023-11-07","name":"Loving this service","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Daisy W."},"datePublished":"2024-09-18","name":"very good experience","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"Very good experience and would highly recommend"},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"steve S."},"datePublished":"2024-06-18","name":"Great service when needing to scrape data","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Verified Reviewer","jobTitle":"CTO"},"datePublished":"2026-03-16","name":"Excellent web scraping solution for agents","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"Had a very positive experience - it took some iterations to find the right scraping options, but the options choice was rich and the documentation quite good."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Yingming T.","jobTitle":"Founder"},"datePublished":"2026-04-07","name":"Reliable scraping platform that saves a lot of engineering time","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"Overall, my experience with Scrapfly has been positive. It is a strong solution for teams that need reliable data extraction without building and maintaining a full scraping infrastructure internally. The product is especially useful when stability matters more than using the cheapest possible tool. It has helped reduce engineering overhead and made collection workflows more manageable."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Gilbert V.","jobTitle":"Growth"},"datePublished":"2026-02-16","name":"Reliable scraping API, easy integration","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"Solid tool for web scraping.Ran a 74k URL scraping job without major issues. Good value with the 200k credits on Discovery plan"},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Verified Reviewer","jobTitle":"CEO"},"datePublished":"2026-02-15","name":"Overall good","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"Easy to get started. The dashboard is fairly well laid out. Overall may occassionally use it as long as prices competitive."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Faten A.","jobTitle":"AI Specialist"},"datePublished":"2026-02-20","name":"Excellent and Reliable Web Scraping Solution","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"My overall experience with Scrapfly has been excellent. It helped me automate a very difficult task that would have been nearly impossible to complete manually. The performance is consistent, the API responses are fast, and the documentation made integration simple. It significantly reduced development time and improved the efficiency of my workflow."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Pedro L.","jobTitle":"Entrepreneur"},"datePublished":"2026-01-05","name":"High-quality service and very beginner-friendly","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"My experience has been great. As a beginner in web scraping, I found it very easy to configure and I've achieved excellent results. It offers a very high quality of service for a fair price, making it a perfect balance for those starting out."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Jacopo C.","jobTitle":"Admin"},"datePublished":"2026-02-23","name":"Web scraping successfull project","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":4,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"The platform is working well and overall I'm satisfied. I need to experience it in a more intensive way to understand the maximum possible use of this platform."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Erhan P.","jobTitle":"Developer"},"datePublished":"2026-02-20","name":"Software developer","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"To give a general overview of our experience, we used about five different systems for the process we wanted to perform, but none worked. However, we have been working flawlessly with this system for 1.5 months now. That's how I can put it."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Victor A.","jobTitle":"CTO"},"datePublished":"2026-01-06","name":"AI Agents LOVE ScrapFly","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"Awesome sauce! I'll keep using them as a big part of my AI automations going forward, they'll definitely make access a breeze"},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Tormund G.","jobTitle":"CTO"},"datePublished":"2025-11-08","name":"A great tool that easily get you started","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"I have tried several similar services, but none of them was as easy to get started with. It just worked."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Greg W.","jobTitle":"CTO"},"datePublished":"2026-03-03","name":"Excellent Service","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"Very smooth and quick to setup with the results we needed in minimal time. Pricing is quite reasonable, with plans that fit our needs."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Emil N.","jobTitle":"Developer"},"datePublished":"2025-11-10","name":"Reliable and easy-to-use scraping API","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"My overall experience has been positive. The signup and setup process were quick, and the API worked as expected once configured. The platform is stable and performs well, making it a solid option for both quick tests and production use, provided you manage your credits carefully."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Pieter-Jan D.","jobTitle":"Managing Director"},"datePublished":"2025-12-20","name":"Would recommend!","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"Extremely positive experience with Scrapfly. I have the feeling I also get good value for money using their service"},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Maxime C.","jobTitle":"SEO and Data Consultant"},"datePublished":"2025-11-22","name":"All-in-one scraping platform that simply works","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"My experience has been consistently positive from start to finish. The platform delivers on its promises without unnecessary complexity. The free tier offers enough credits to thoroughly evaluate the service before committing financially. When I needed support, [sensitive content hidden] was responsive and helpful, resolving my questions promptly (even under free-tier). I particularly appreciated the straightforward, no-pressure approach, no aggressive upselling or intrusive marketing tactics. The service simply works well and lets you focus on your scraping projects rather than fighting with the tool itself."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Nuri A.","jobTitle":"Owner"},"datePublished":"2025-12-23","name":"Scrapfly absolutely worth it","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"I really like the experience so far. I tried other scrapers but they were nowhere near this successful. Value for Money is perfect. Automatic proxy selection saves money most of the time. Learning Curve was a little steep but once done it works."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Stephen C.","jobTitle":"Engineer"},"datePublished":"2025-04-14","name":"Solid and Reliable Webscraping Package with lots of features","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"I wanted to outsource my webscraping to a high quality tool I could always integrate with and lean on for high quality output. It has proven this for me with no issues at all."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Verified Reviewer","jobTitle":"AI developer"},"datePublished":"2026-04-14","name":"simple and useful","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"I solved a scraping problem with scrapFly while it was impossible doing it with any other one. i tried."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Channing S.","jobTitle":"Principal Researcher"},"datePublished":"2025-04-30","name":"Excellent Product & Responsive Support Team","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1}},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Bohdan D.","jobTitle":"CTO"},"datePublished":"2025-12-30","name":"Good straightforward service","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"Overall, it has been a positive experience with no complains, hopefully it will be the same in the long run"},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Verified Reviewer","jobTitle":"Co-Founder"},"datePublished":"2026-03-12","name":"Works as intended.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"My overall experience with Scrapfly has been very positive. I'm very happy with the platform and especially enjoy using the API, which is powerful, reliable, and easy to integrate into my workflows."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"yitzchak B.","jobTitle":"Software Engineer"},"datePublished":"2025-10-28","name":"Overall one of the most convenient scraping APIs to date","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"Great experience, stable API that works properly with a wide ability to configure almost every possible parameter"},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Alan S.","jobTitle":"CEO"},"datePublished":"2026-02-18","name":"Easy to start with proof of concept","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"Postitive so far, the dashboard is great for monitoring costs and once you get the API key you are up and running in minutes. It was great to have the free credit to test proof of concept"},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Sid D.","jobTitle":"CEO"},"datePublished":"2025-03-24","name":"Great Product.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"Pretty satisfactory. i use it for scraping a few things, but I would love to use it even more."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Magnus E.","jobTitle":"PhD Fellow"},"datePublished":"2026-03-11","name":"Easy to Use Scraping Software","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"Scrapfly has been easy and allowed me to save multiple days of work. I anticipate using it for future projects as well."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Tomas P.","jobTitle":"CEO"},"datePublished":"2025-11-16","name":"Easy setup, good support, rich variety of target websites to fit your research needs.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"Would highly recommend. Looking forward to using it periodically for market trend, competitor analysis on Etsy and later other websites too."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Geoffrey H.","jobTitle":"President"},"datePublished":"2025-10-08","name":"Recommended API for scraping","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"Been using it for more than a week and the results are consistent. Tried it initially because I was using a competitor that didn't work as expected."},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Val O.","jobTitle":"Sr Engineer"},"datePublished":"2025-11-13","name":"A must have for the serious scraping project","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"As mentioned the python sdk is great and intuitive it also works well with other frameworks like asyncio with just url slugs so the setup is versatile. Features like asp and javascript rendering take most of the headaches out of scraping"},{"@type":"Review","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Ryan M.","jobTitle":"Owner"},"datePublished":"2026-02-22","name":"Holy Scrapfly! So many tools!","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5,"worstRating":1},"reviewBody":"Overall my experience was great. I couldnt believe all the tools they had at their dispense. I found several others that i plan to use as soon as i build my business up."}]}</script>

